{
  // English (en) locale corrections.
  //
  // These patches fix strings that are broken in tarkov.dev's English
  // translation bundle specifically. They are NOT data corrections: a regular
  // override in src/overrides/tasks.json5 says "the canonical value is X
  // regardless of locale", while an entry here says "the English bundle should
  // show X" (other locale bundles may already be correct). Consumers apply
  // these only when rendering the matching locale, after data overrides.
  //
  // An empty object is valid and skipped at build time; the file stays so
  // status-locale and the locale tests have a stable English baseline to read.
  //
  // New Beginning (Prestige 2/3/4) - 6761ff17cdc36bd66102e9d0,
  // 6848100b00afffa81f09e365, 68481881f43abfdda2058369. The en bundle used to
  // resolve their name to the German string and their wikiLink to the German
  // wiki page; tarkov.dev now serves "New Beginning" and the English
  // New_Beginning_(Prestige_N) pages in every mode, so the patches were removed
  // after `npm run check-overrides -- --fail-on-stale` reported all six fields
  // as "bundle now matches override".
  // Was: name 'Neuanfang', wikiLink https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/wiki/Neuanfang
  // Proof: https://json.tarkov.dev/regular/tasks_en (keys "<task-id> name")
  //        https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/wiki/New_Beginning_(Prestige_2)
}
